{"title": "Gull Feather", "icon": "simplywings:gull_feather", "blocks": [{"type": "items", "items": ["simplywings:gull_feather"]}, {"type": "text", "text": "It smells of salt and long journeys, of shores that never end."}, {"type": "heading", "text": "Where to find it"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Cast a winged fishing rod from a beach: the gulls will pay their toll."}, {"type": "heading", "text": "Used in"}, {"type": "items", "items": ["simplywings:gull_core", "simplywings:gull_wing"]}]}